Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.63,0:00:07.72,Default,OHNO,0,0,0,,Edhe një vit tjetër po i vjen fundi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.72,0:00:08.86,Default,OBATA,0,0,0,,Ashtu është me të vërtetë.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.86,0:00:13.62,Default,OHNO,0,0,0,,Bëre një punë të shkëlqyer me përgatitjen e këndit\Ntë perimeve për Vitin e Ri, Obata-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.10,0:00:16.63,Default,OBATA,0,0,0,,V-Vërtet e keni?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.63,0:00:19.25,Default,OBATA,0,0,0,,M-Mendoj se puna në turnin e natës\Nia vlejti më në fund.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.76,0:00:28.40,Default,OHNO,0,0,0,,E vlerësoj që karotat tona kintoki\Ndhe rrepat e supës janë të mëdha dhe të bukura.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.40,0:00:30.60,Default,OBATA,0,0,0,,Oh, ju falënderoj shumë.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.90,0:00:36.52,Default,OHNO,0,0,0,,Punë e mbarë, Yamada-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.52,0:00:38.40,Default,OBATA,0,0,0,,H-Hej, Yamada.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.99,0:00:40.64,Default,YAMADA,0,0,0,,Ç'kemi?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.77,0:00:44.69,Default,OHNO,0,0,0,,Nuk do të hash darkë?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.69,0:00:49.06,Default,YAMADA,0,0,0,,Po e kaloj sonte. Nuk kam uri.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.06,0:00:50.15,Default,OHNO,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.15,0:00:55.28,Signs,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5\fnTimes New Roman\b0\fs16\3c&H3E25CE&\pos(139.5,211)}XXL
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.15,0:00:55.28,Signs,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\c&H40415A&\frz25.69\pos(137.5,7.5)}shumë e madhe
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.15,0:00:55.28,Signs,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\c&H40415A&\pos(84.5,37)\frz25.69}gëlltitje
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.15,0:00:55.28,Signs,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\c&H40415A&\frz25.69\pos(84.9,52.63)}gëlltitje
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.46,0:00:52.74,DefaultItalics,OBATA,0,0,0,,{\i0}Yamada po{\i1}anashkalon një vakt?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.74,0:00:55.28,DefaultItalics,OBATA,0,0,0,,Mos është në dietë apo diçka e tillë?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.69,0:01:03.30,Default,OHNO,0,0,0,,Yamada-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.96,0:01:03.30,DefaultOverlap,OBATA,0,0,0,,Yamada!
